---
// src/components/landing/Faq.astro
---

<section id="faq" class="py-16 bg-white dark:bg-[#09090b] border-t border-neutral-200 dark:border-neutral-800 transition-colors no-print">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 space-y-10">
    <div class="text-center space-y-2">
      <span data-i18n="faqEyebrow" class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-400 font-medium">Got Questions?</span>
      <h2 data-i18n="faqTitle" class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-neutral-950 dark:text-white">
        Frequently Asked Questions
      </h2>
      <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400">
        Everything you need to know about our free quote generator, features, and privacy standards.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="divide-y divide-neutral-200 dark:divide-neutral-800 border-y border-neutral-200 dark:border-neutral-800 text-xs sm:text-sm">
      <details class="py-4 group">
        <summary class="font-semibold text-neutral-900 dark:text-white cursor-pointer list-none flex justify-between items-center">
          Is Quote Generator Free truly 100% free with no hidden charges?
          <span class="text-neutral-400 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform">▼</span>
        </summary>
        <p class="text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400 mt-2 text-xs leading-relaxed">
          Yes! You can create, preview, customize, and download unlimited PDF quotations and estimates completely free of charge. There are no subscriptions, no credit cards required, and no hidden paywalls.
        </p>
      </details>

      <details class="py-4 group">
        <summary class="font-semibold text-neutral-900 dark:text-white cursor-pointer list-none flex justify-between items-center">
          Do I need to create an account or sign in to use this quotation generator software?
          <span class="text-neutral-400 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform">▼</span>
        </summary>
        <p class="text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400 mt-2 text-xs leading-relaxed">
          No registration or account creation is required. You can launch the quote builder immediately upon landing on the site, draft your estimate, and download a professional PDF in seconds.
        </p>
      </details>

      <details class="py-4 group">
        <summary class="font-semibold text-neutral-900 dark:text-white cursor-pointer list-none flex justify-between items-center">
          Is my client, company, and financial data secure and private?
          <span class="text-neutral-400 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform">▼</span>
        </summary>
        <p class="text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400 mt-2 text-xs leading-relaxed">
          Absolutely. Unlike traditional SaaS cloud tools that store your sensitive commercial data on remote servers, Quote Generator Free executes 100% in your browser. Nothing is ever sent to or stored on an external database.
        </p>
      </details>

      <details class="py-4 group">
        <summary class="font-semibold text-neutral-900 dark:text-white cursor-pointer list-none flex justify-between items-center">
          Can contractors, freelancers, and B2B wholesalers use this quote creation tool?
          <span class="text-neutral-400 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform">▼</span>
        </summary>
        <p class="text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400 mt-2 text-xs leading-relaxed">
          Yes. Our quote generator provides specialized features for construction quote generation, contractor line items, freelance milestones, and B2B/wholesale bulk discounts with multi-tier taxes and currencies.
        </p>
      </details>

      <details class="py-4 group">
        <summary class="font-semibold text-neutral-900 dark:text-white cursor-pointer list-none flex justify-between items-center">
          Does the software support client quote approvals with digital signatures?
          <span class="text-neutral-400 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform">▼</span>
        </summary>
        <p class="text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400 mt-2 text-xs leading-relaxed">
          Yes. The built-in digital signature pad allows you and your clients to sign directly using a touchscreen or mouse, or type an authorized name to create legally clear, signed quotes ready for instant sign-off.
        </p>
      </details>

      <details class="py-4 group">
        <summary class="font-semibold text-neutral-900 dark:text-white cursor-pointer list-none flex justify-between items-center">
          How does this quote builder compare to complex CPQ software?
          <span class="text-neutral-400 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform">▼</span>
        </summary>
        <p class="text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400 mt-2 text-xs leading-relaxed">
          Traditional CPQ (Configure, Price, Quote) platforms take weeks to configure and cost thousands of dollars per seat. Our automated quote generator delivers the essential Configure-Price-Quote capabilities—line items, percentage discounts, multi-tax calculations, and dynamic totals—with zero setup time and zero cost.
        </p>
      </details>

      <details class="py-4 group">
        <summary class="font-semibold text-neutral-900 dark:text-white cursor-pointer list-none flex justify-between items-center">
          What logo formats and designer quote templates are supported?
          <span class="text-neutral-400 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform">▼</span>
        </summary>
        <p class="text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400 mt-2 text-xs leading-relaxed">
          Our Universal Logo Engine supports PNG, JPG, JPEG, SVG vector graphics, WebP, and GIF. You can customize five designer quote templates (Minimalist, Corporate, Creative, Nordic, and Compact) with your unique brand accent colors.
        </p>
      </details>

      <details class="py-4 group">
        <summary class="font-semibold text-neutral-900 dark:text-white cursor-pointer list-none flex justify-between items-center">
          Can I convert quotes into invoices or export printable PDF quotes?
          <span class="text-neutral-400 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform">▼</span>
        </summary>
        <p class="text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400 mt-2 text-xs leading-relaxed">
          Yes. You can switch between "Quote" and "Invoice" titles instantly, reuse existing quote line items for final billing, and export high-resolution vector PDF documents calibrated for A4 and Letter printing.
        </p>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
